From: Li Guan <guanli.oerv@isrc.iscas.ac.cn>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 03:32:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] build: require the selected FUSE 3 pkg-config module

openRuyi builds the low-level library with FUSE 3. Its pkg-config file
must request fuse3 so development consumers resolve the matching headers
and libraries instead of the unavailable FUSE 2 module.

Reference: https://github.com/vasi/squashfuse/blob/0.6.5/squashfuse_ll.pc.in
Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [distribution FUSE 3 selection]
Signed-off-by: Li Guan <guanli.oerv@isrc.iscas.ac.cn>
---
diff --git a/squashfuse_ll.pc.in b/squashfuse_ll.pc.in
--- a/squashfuse_ll.pc.in
+++ b/squashfuse_ll.pc.in
@@ -8,6 +8,6 @@ Description: squashfuse low-level library to mount squashfs archives
 Version: @VERSION@
 
 Requires: squashfuse
-Requires.private: fuse
+Requires.private: fuse3
 Libs: -L${libdir} -lsquashfuse_ll
 Cflags: -I${includedir}
